flowchart LR

A[God Creates Spirit<br/>Simple and Ignorant]

subgraph B0[Spirit World: Beginning]
  B1[Free spirit state<br/>First awareness, first guidance]
  B2[Preparation for incarnation]
  B1 --> B2
end

A --> B1

subgraph C0[Earthly World or Similar Lower World]
  C1[Incarnation]
  C2[Veil of forgetfulness]
  C3[Earthly life in dense matter<br/>Family, work, suffering, temptation, service]
  C4[Use of free will<br/>Good or evil choices]
  C1 --> C2 --> C3 --> C4
end

B2 --> C1

subgraph D0[Spirit World After Lower-World Life]
  D1[Physical death]
  D2[Reawakening as spirit]
  D3[Lucidity or confusion<br/>according to moral state]
  D4[Review of deeds, attachments, and omissions]
  D5[Remorse, peace, learning, repair, preparation]
  D1 --> D2 --> D3 --> D4 --> D5
end

C4 --> D1

D5 --> E{Has the spirit truly progressed?}

E -->|No| F[Return to the same world<br/>or a similar lower world]
F --> C1

E -->|Yes| G[Ready for a less material world]

subgraph H0[More Advanced World / Regenerated World]
  H1[Incarnation in a better world]
  H2[Lighter trials<br/>Less violence, selfishness, and material struggle]
  H3[Broader duties and clearer conscience]
  H4[Further moral and intellectual growth]
  H1 --> H2 --> H3 --> H4
end

G --> H1

subgraph I0[Spirit World After Higher-World Life]
  I1[Return to spirit life]
  I2[Clearer review and wider understanding]
  I3[Preparation for higher service or another world]
  I1 --> I2 --> I3
end

H4 --> I1

I3 --> J{Pure spirit?}

J -->|No| K{Ready for a still higher world?}
K -->|No| H1
K -->|Yes| L[Advance to a still higher world]

subgraph M0[Higher and Higher Worlds]
  M1[Incarnation in worlds of increasing refinement]
  M2[Fewer material burdens<br/>Greater charity, wisdom, and freedom]
  M3[Repeated life, death, review, and ascent]
  M1 --> M2 --> M3
end

L --> M1
M3 --> I1

J -->|Yes| N[Pure Spirit / Angelic State]
N --> O[No more material incarnation]
O --> P[Constant happiness without idleness<br/>Free and active service under divine law]
